@startuml navigation-shell-state
' Context: navigation
' Profile: client
' Revision: 2026-07-27
' Statechart: NavigationShellState + ConversationScope

title Navigation — shell e ambito conversazione

state InboxVisible : committedScope = null
state ChatOpen : committedScope = (owner, peer, epoch)
state GroupShell : committedScope = null\ngroupChatOpen in view-state

[*] --> InboxVisible

InboxVisible --> ChatOpen : OpenConversation\n(OpenPeerOnFocusedAccount |\nOpenConversationOnAccount)\nCommitConversationScope
InboxVisible --> GroupShell : EnterGroupShell\n(SwitchToAccount gruppo)\nInvalidateConversationScope
InboxVisible --> InboxVisible : ShowInbox\n(SwitchToAccount utente)\nInvalidateConversationScope

ChatOpen --> InboxVisible : CloseConversation\nInvalidateConversationScope
ChatOpen --> ChatOpen : OpenConversation (altro peer)\nInvalidate → Commit
ChatOpen --> InboxVisible : ShowInbox\n(SwitchToAccount utente)\nInvalidateConversationScope
ChatOpen --> GroupShell : EnterGroupShell\n(SwitchToAccount gruppo)\nInvalidateConversationScope

GroupShell --> GroupShell : OpenGroupConversation\n(OpenGroupChat)
GroupShell --> GroupShell : LeaveGroupConversation\n(BackToGroupHome)
GroupShell --> GroupShell : EnterGroupShell\n(SwitchToAccount gruppo)\nInvalidateConversationScope
GroupShell --> InboxVisible : ShowInbox\n(SwitchToAccount utente)\nInvalidateConversationScope
GroupShell --> InboxVisible : CloseConversation\n(utente in focus)\nInvalidateConversationScope

note right of ChatOpen
  Un solo [ConversationScope] commesso.
  Messaging legge solo da qui.
  activePeer in view-state è proiezione UI.
end note

note right of GroupShell
  Chat gruppo: evento GroupConversationVisible
  (view-state groupChatOpen), non ChatOpen.
  Scope 1:1 sempre null.
end note

@enduml
